<title>POLAND: FarmFood corrects net for Q2 1996.</title>
<headline>FarmFood corrects net for Q2 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Farm Food preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 4.07 vs     5.01</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.57 vs     2.81</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.17 vs     0.82</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Farm Food SA. Earlier the company said its net profit was at 3.04 million zlotys.</p>
<p>    net sales				 62.75 vs    47.28</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  53.11 vs    39.01</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.01 vs     0.03</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.39  vs    1.99</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.43 vs     1.68</p>
<p>    financial costs			  1.94vs	3.85</p>
<p>    investment				14.28 vs     6.01</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 7.80 vs    11.09</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   4.91 vs     7.45</p>
<p>    net profit				 2.40 vs     4.25</p>
<p>    net sales				119.74 vs    95.25</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 102.57 vs    79.21</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs     0.03</p>
<p>    income tax				 2.51 vs     3.20</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs     0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     1.19 vs     2.59</p>
<p>    financial costs			  4.08 vs     6.20</p>
<p>    investment				24.67 vs    11.84</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
